+# Pattern: Design Quality Gate
+
+Run this gate after drafting and before Review Gate. Inspect only the artifacts
+listed in `Report.md` State.
+
+1. Map every framed requirement and constraint to a decision or an explicit
+   not-applicable record.
+2. Confirm every material concern in the preliminary scan has an artifact,
+   owning requirement, or developer decision, with evidence in `Report.md`.
+3. Check that solution artifacts contain decisions and interfaces, not rationale,
+   rejected options, or unresolved placeholders.
+4. Render every Mermaid diagram with the repository's available Mermaid CLI or
+   documented equivalent. If no CLI is available, record that limitation and run
+   a syntax-oriented inspection.
+5. Check all relative links in the selected artifacts resolve from their file
+   locations.
+6. Record pass/fail and remediation in `Report.md` before opening the review gate.
+
+Any failed item keeps Solution incomplete until resolved or explicitly accepted by
+the developer.
